#AltText&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A close-up of a bunch of rowan berries that have already turned red – in Norway, a sure sign that autumn is beginning. For a long time, the abundance of berries has been seen as a predictor of what the winter will be like. The saying quoted here goes: ‘When the rowan trees are laden with berries, the winter will be long and harsh.’" height="3000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/roteskuffen/6a72dd601b906.jpg" width="3000"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://roteskuffen.some.pics"&gt;@roteskuffen&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 06:51:15 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a726a2b8c993</link><description>&lt;p&gt;游戏《Herdling》在第一个游戏日结束时的截图。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A screenshot of the game Herdling, at the end of the first game day. It depicts 5 precious Calicorns which are the fictitious herd animal in the game that you care for. They are seen around a fire in an industrial setting and are all sleeping." height="900" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a726a2b8c993.jpg" width="1600"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:39:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a72695763dba</link><description>&lt;p&gt;《Herdling》游戏的一张截图，拍摄于离开城市后不久。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A screenshot of the game Herdling, not long after leaving the city. It depicts 3 precious Calicorns which are the fictitious herd animal in the game that you care for. They are seen in a countryside setting, with the sun rising over distant mountains making for long shadows." height="900" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/maz/6a72695763dba.jpg" width="1600"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://maz.some.pics"&gt;@maz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 22:36:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a724a33e830a</link><description>&lt;p&gt;夜的栖居者。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Backyard plants, flashlight image. Night." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a724a33e830a.jpg" width="1125"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 20:23:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a724827cdace</link><description>&lt;p&gt;Greenhouse起始页的截图&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="Screenshot of the Greenhouse start page" height="1179" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/geewiz/6a724827cdace.png" width="1593"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://geewiz.some.pics"&gt;@geewiz&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 20:14:35 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>